## 💡 Lessons Learned & Anti-Regression Log

*This log records project-specific post-mortems and gotchas to prevent repeating past mistakes.*

- 💡 **Lesson 1:** *Dio interceptor must remain a singleton in `lib/core/network/` to prevent token refreshing race conditions.*
- 💡 **Lesson 2:** *Always use `const` constructors on static `Icon` and `Text` widgets inside `ListView.builder` to maintain 120 FPS scrolling.*
- 💡 **Lesson 3:** *Never store authentication JWT tokens in `SharedPreferences`; use `flutter_secure_storage`.*

